# Beads: the Dolt working copy and every local artifact of it. The tracker lives in
# Dolt and syncs through refs/dolt/data on the git remote, so the JSONL export and
# the interaction log carry nothing the remote does not already have.
.beads/embeddeddolt/
.beads/backup/
.beads/last-touched
.beads/export-state.json
.beads/interactions.jsonl
.beads/issues.jsonl

# Pipeline work files (repair lists, markers)
references/work/

# Row worktrees, which `bd worktree create .beads/worktrees/<id>` puts here. They
# stay under the repo root so that `.taskrunner.toml` at the root is at or above
# each one and every worktree inherits this repository's resource defaults. bd
# still writes and removes its own entry per worktree; against this rule those are
# redundant, and they still cancel.
/.beads/worktrees/
